        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 In One Line:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Beyond Tetris — discover the joy of creation.”</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stack, Erase, and Create.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The history of block puzzles changes here and now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed <strong>single-handedly by Japanese creator Nakamura</strong>, <i>DELTARIS</i> is nothing less than a <strong>revolution in falling-block puzzle games</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【About the Game】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DELTARIS</i> redefines the classic falling-block genre as a <strong>brand-new style of puzzle RPG</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Already mastered TETRIS?”<br>Then it’s time to experience <i>DELTA FORCE</i> — a groundbreaking system where <strong>placing blocks in special shapes automatically “creates” new ones</strong> that fill the gaps.<br>Every flash of insight can trigger massive chains and unleash thrilling attacks on your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge a new chapter in puzzle history — through creation itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Key Features】</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● The Innovative “Delta Force” System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just stacking blocks. By intentionally forming <strong>triangular gaps</strong>, new blocks called <i>Delta Forces</i> are automatically generated!<br>Plan, create, and dominate the field with strategic chain reactions unlike anything you’ve played before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● Puzzle Meets RPG in Dynamic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing lines that include Delta Forces activates <strong>Delta Attacks</strong>, dealing damage to your enemies!<br>Face off against fairy-tale and myth-inspired foes, each with unique HP and abilities.<br>It’s not just about score — it’s about <i>defeating enemies</i> and <i>progressing through stages</i> for a true sense of accomplishment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● Massive Variety of Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a wealth of content: a full <strong>Story Mode</strong>, an <strong>Endless Mode</strong> that tests your limits,<br>over <strong>24 Mission challenges</strong>, a logical <strong>Puzzle Mode</strong>, and exciting <strong>2-Player Versus Battles</strong> for local play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● An Epic Story to Save the World of Tales</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the sanctuary of dreams known as <strong>Castle Mugen</strong>, all stories are born.<br>But now, they are being corrupted by the mysterious “Dark Ink,” turning beloved heroes into demons.<br>Take on the role of <i>Delru</i>, the girl who inherited the Delta Force, and embark on an adventure with <i>General Mikage the Cat</i> to restore the purity of these lost tales.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Game Modes】</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> – Experience a 12-stage narrative as Delru and uncover the truth behind the Dark Ink.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong> – Battle an endless wave of enemies and chase high scores with or without items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission Mode</strong> – Complete diverse challenges that test both speed and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Mode</strong> – Solve cleverly designed stages using limited blocks and moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lesson Mode</strong> – Learn the basics and advanced Delta Force techniques with Delru’s guidance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2P Versus Mode</strong> – Compete locally with a friend using unique “Salvation Items” for each character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus Mode</strong> – Unlock the ultimate challenge reserved only for true masters of every mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096640/extras/6f7c7049a12af999082d6c2c7fdc632e.avif?t=1764860480\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
